# Deployment Guide

## Jubilant Computing Machine - Production Deployment

**Owner:** MORLEY MOSES APOOCH
**Version:** 1.0.0
**License:** BSD 3-Clause

---

## Prerequisites

- Node.js 14.0.0 or higher
- npm or yarn package manager
- Valid BSD 3-Clause License compliance

## Installation

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/morlzappoch/jubilant-computing-machine.git
cd jubilant-computing-machine

# Install dependencies
npm install
